lass=\"obc-tmpl__rate-icon\"></i><i class=\"obc-tmpl__rate-icon obc-tmpl__rate-icon--inactive\"></i></div></div></td> <td colspan=\"3\" class=\"obc-tmpl__rich-text\"><p style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">提高输出和辅助能力，武器主动技能提供流血积蓄值。</p></td></tr></tbody></table> <!----></div></div><div style=\"order: 1;\"> <div data-part=\"review\" data-tmpl=\"weapon\" class=\"obc-tmpl__part obc-tmpl-weapon obc-tmpl__part--review obc-tmpl__part--align-banner\"><h2>武器测评</h2> <div class=\"obc-tmpl-valkyrie__skill-container\"><div><img src=\"https://uploadstatic.mihoyo.com/bh3-wiki/2022/06/01/50494840/fe03158f1e8cf2ecc4607b2700b7995d_1708183498727405096.gif\" class=\"mobile-gif\"></div> <div class=\"obc-tmpl-valkyrie__skill-item\"><div class=\"obc-tmpl-valkyrie__skill-item-desc\"><div class=\"text\"><p style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">较为全面的物理辅助十字架武器，提高自身分支攻击和必杀技的全伤害，提高全队物理伤害，具有一定辅助能力，使用主动技能后还可对敌人施加物理易伤，一进步提升输出和辅助能力。</p><p style=\"white-space: pre-wrap; min-height: 1.5em;\"></p><p style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">繁星 · 绘世之卷使用时拥有额外机制，释放武器主动可同时触发极限闪避技能，且QTE入场时自动释放武器主动技能，优化了整体流程循环。</p></div> <div class=\"obc-tmpl-valkyrie__skill-item-desc-gif\" style=\"padding: 0px;\"><img src=\"https://uploadstatic.mihoyo.com/bh3-wiki/2022/06/01/50494840/fe03158f1e8cf2ecc4607b2700b7995d_1708183498727405096.gif\" alt=\"\"></div></div></div></div> <!----></div></div></div></div></div> <div data-v-f0365338=\"\" class=\"detail__body-endpart\"><hr data-v-f0365338=\"\"> <p data-v-f0365338=\"\" class=\"detail__copyright\"><img data-v-f0365338=\"\" src=\"data:image/png;base64,\">\n        词条内容由圣芙蕾雅档案馆编辑团队原创，禁止转载\n      </p></div> <!---->",
